                   at port 49737 we were then asked to enter pswd to get the flag.

3. what is net cat?: here we had to use nc which is a powerful networking utility 
                         used for reading and writing data across network connections 
                         using TCP or UDP protocol. We use this cmd to get the flag 
                        from port 55525 for fickle.tempest.picoctf.net.

